+/*
+ * LOAD_LIBRARY_SEARCH_* flags were added to Vista and Windows 7 by
+ * KB2533623.  On an unpatched system LoadLibraryExW() rejects those flags
+ * with ERROR_INVALID_PARAMETER.  The module path passed by the import
+ * machinery is absolute, so LOAD_WITH_ALTERED_SEARCH_PATH is the closest
+ * pre-KB equivalent: it searches the extension module's directory before
+ * the normal DLL search locations.
